charges that could be filed against Donald Trump.&nbsp;
We've got Jim Jordan getting smacked down by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:24.840
Manhattan District Attorney Alvin Bragg. We've got&nbsp;
MAGA freaks coming out in droves to attack former&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:32.520
Trump lawyer Jenna Ellis. All that and much, much&nbsp;
more is coming up. So let's jump right into it. As&nbsp;&nbsp;

