and dangle that potential charge in front of any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:10.080
witness that may not want to fully cooperate and&nbsp;
say, listen, you don't have to tell me everything,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:15.240
