want you to know that here in my back pocket.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:21.600
I have obstructing an official government&nbsp;
proceeding and I can charge you with this.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:28.080
It's very obvious that your involvement on that&nbsp;
particular day led to the postponement of that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:34.260
Electoral College vote. And that is illegal.&nbsp;
So I don't want to hit you with these charges,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:43.320
but I am more than willing to do it if you do&nbsp;
not cooperate. Now, some people may hear that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:48.600
and think, wow, that kind of seems a little little&nbsp;
underhanded. But trust me, it's not. Things like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:54.660
