what would happen if he's able to do this again.&nbsp;
It's going to depend on the Supreme Court. That's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:57.660
one of those wait and see moments that I know none&nbsp;
of us like, but that's where we stand right now.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:03.480
Could be a new charge against Donald Trump, could&nbsp;
be a bargaining chip. Either way, the wind's at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:10.984
his back, Right. Jack Smith holds all the cards&nbsp;
